{"version":1,"content":"<p>視帝張振朗舊愛陳芷尤（現名陳思帆）自2019年離巢後返回新加坡發展，前年3月與圈外男友步入婚姻殿堂並誕下長子，一家三口幸福美滿。</p><p>今年5月，她再報喜宣布懷上第二胎，成功湊成「好」字。</p><p>然而，今年9月卻突傳驚險消息，她因意外穿羊水，被迫在懷孕32</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T11:24:00.815030+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T11:01:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T11:17:13.663309+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T11:17:13.663309+00:00","content_hash":"f3e8ffa65a2978b3934115b64d4367e7ec7f1fc35b711acf7cbfda37943acaaa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}